   "source": [
    "Question 10: What is the difference between flatten() and ravel() in NumPy?\n",
    "--Easy answer:\n",
    "\n",
    "Both are used to convert a multi-dimensional array into a 1D array."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "3ee3bb3f-2b26-4037-aa25-997f499620f2",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "arr=np.array([\n",
    "    [1,2,3],\n",
    "     [4,5,6]\n",
    "])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
